SPARTA (24 Sep 2025)
Running on 4 MPI task(s)
################################################################################
# 3d box with a surf_collide model on two box faces
#
# Exercises an {s} global boundary whose collision model is a plain specular
# one.  On an axis-aligned box face that model is a reflection about the face
# and nothing else, so the optimized move performs it itself and hands the
# collisions to the model afterwards -- sc_ID[1] and sc_ID[2] below count the
# same collisions either way.
#
# A specular model with the noslip option, or any other collision model, is
# not a mirror and those faces still use the normal move.
#
# Run the same script with "-var opt no" to compare against the normal move.
# On a single processor the two agree exactly, step for step, including the
# two surf_collide tallies.
#
# Note:
#  - The "comm/sort" option to the "global" command is used to match MPI runs.
################################################################################

variable            opt index yes

seed	    	    12345
dimension   	    3
global              gridcut 0.0 comm/sort yes optmove ${opt}
global              gridcut 0.0 comm/sort yes optmove yes

boundary	    s p p

create_box  	    0 0.001 0 0.001 0 0.001
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (0.001 0.001 0.001)
create_grid 	    10 10 10
WARNING: Could not acquire nearby ghost cells b/c grid partition is not clumped (../grid.cpp:483)
Created 1000 child grid cells
  CPU time = 0.00244124 secs
  create/ghost percent = 97.8168 2.18323
balance_grid        rcb part
Balance grid migrated 740 cells
  CPU time = 0.000726747 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 47.845 6.69559 15.0766 30.3828

surf_collide        spec specular
bound_modify        xlo xhi collide spec

species		    ar.species Ar
mixture		    air Ar vstream 200.0 100.0 -150.0 temp 300.0

global		    nrho 1.e20 fnum 1.e7

create_particles    air n 0
Created 9999 particles
  CPU time = 0.00181641 secs
collide             vss air ar.vss

fix                 gcheck grid/check 1 error

# nsingle and ntotal of the surf_collide model, which the optimized move
# keeps up to date for the collisions it performs itself

variable            nsingle equal sc_spec[1]
variable            ntotal  equal sc_spec[2]

stats		    100
stats_style	    step cpu np nbound v_nsingle v_ntotal

timestep            1.e-6
run 		    500
